[
  {
    "text": "A Kodiak woman asked Google when",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.5900000000000003,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "snipe season opens.",
    "start": 2.62,
    "end": 3.74,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "Its A I answer said September",
    "start": 4.74,
    "end": 6.77,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "first.",
    "start": 6.8,
    "end": 7.5,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "So on September fifth she shot",
    "start": 8.16,
    "end": 10.57,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "three snipe.",
    "start": 10.6,
    "end": 11.46,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "At home she looked up the",
    "start": 12.44,
    "end": 13.97,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "state regulations and saw her mistake.",
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 16.28,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "She called troopers and turned",
    "start": 17.06,
    "end": 19.009999999999998,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "herself in.",
    "start": 19.04,
    "end": 19.74,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "The trooper's report says the general",
    "start": 20.9,
    "end": 23.029999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "season opened October eighth.",
    "start": 23.06,
    "end": 25.44,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "So two pages disagreed.",
    "start": 26.06,
    "end": 28.4,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "Which one can a hunter trust?",
    "start": 28.9,
    "end": 30.58,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "That trooper ran her exact search.",
    "start": 31.72,
    "end": 34.24,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "He got the same wrong answer.",
    "start": 35.22,
    "end": 37.0,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "She still pleaded no contest and",
    "start": 38.18,
    "end": 40.81,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "paid a hundred fifty dollars.",
    "start": 40.84,
    "end": 41.8,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "She told the Alaska Beacon, I",
    "start": 42.54,
    "end": 45.089999999999996,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "feel terrible.",
    "start": 45.12,
    "end": 46.16,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "State spokesman Austin McDaniel",
    "start": 47.7,
    "end": 49.769999999999996,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "thinks it's the first time A",
    "start": 49.8,
    "end": 51.5,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "I has been cited.",
    "start": 51.53,
    "end": 52.52,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "He expects more.",
    "start": 53.34,
    "end": 54.26,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "Weren't there warnings?",
    "start": 55.26,
    "end": 56.15,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "There were.",
    "start": 56.18,
    "end": 57.54,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "Google's help page says A I",
    "start": 58.46,
    "end": 60.15,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "answers may include mistakes, and",
    "start": 60.18,
    "end": 62.75,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "to check more than one place.",
    "start": 62.78,
    "end": 64.3,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "Google didn't respond to the Beacon's",
    "start": 65.14,
    "end": 67.01,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "request for comment.",
    "start": 67.04,
    "end": 67.82,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "McDaniel says the one source of",
    "start": 69.12,
    "end": 71.21,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "truth is Fish and Game's regulations",
    "start": 71.24,
    "end": 73.19,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "and emergency orders.",
    "start": 73.22,
    "end": 74.5,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "But that source has a catch.",
    "start": 75.12,
    "end": 77.1,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "Fish and Game's own page says",
    "start": 78.02,
    "end": 80.09,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "its online regulations are simplified,",
    "start": 80.12,
    "end": 82.14,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "and emergency orders can override",
    "start": 82.68,
    "end": 84.53,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "them.",
    "start": 84.56,
    "end": 84.87,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "So even the official page is",
    "start": 84.9,
    "end": 87.91,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "a summary.",
    "start": 87.94,
    "end": 88.64,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer was on top.",
    "start": 89.72,
    "end": 91.04,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "What counts sits underneath.",
    "start": 92.02,
    "end": 94.04,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "Check the regulations and any emergency",
    "start": 95.0,
    "end": 97.59,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "order.",
    "start": 97.62,
    "end": 98.32000000000001,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "Fish and Game will mail you",
    "start": 98.62,
    "end": 99.92999999999999,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "a copy.",
    "start": 99.96,
    "end": 100.66,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "Before you hunt, what do you",
    "start": 101.48,
    "end": 103.75,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "check?",
    "start": 103.78,
    "end": 104.48,
    "seg": 19
  }
]